!to run, enter following SLAM command in GADDS cmd line:
!@C:\robot\scripts\mergeAndIntegrate2.slm [job name] [frame width] [theta1+theta2]
!%1 = job name
!%2 = frame width
!%3 = theta1 + theta2 for initial frame (30 = 20+15)

